        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="iIMRzTf35lxI4AUppVfz-324" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;font data-font-src=&quot;https://fonts.googleapis.com/css?family=Architects+Daughter&quot; face=&quot;Architects Daughter&quot;&gt;Raft consensus algorithm (leader election part)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font data-font-src=&quot;https://fonts.googleapis.com/css?family=Architects+Daughter&quot; face=&quot;Architects Daughter&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;font data-font-src=&quot;https://fonts.googleapis.com/css?family=Architects+Daughter&quot; face=&quot;Architects Daughter&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;caret-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;If the leader becomes unavailable, followers use randomized election timeouts. A follower becomes a candidate, increments the Raft term, votes for itself and requests votes from other replicas. A candidate whose log is sufficiently up-to-date and receives a majority becomes the new leader. Because committed entries were replicated to a quorum, the new leader preserves committed state.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font data-font-src=&quot;https://fonts.googleapis.com/css?family=Architects+Daughter&quot; face=&quot;Architects Daughter&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font data-font-src=&quot;https://fonts.googleapis.com/css?family=Architects+Daughter&quot; face=&quot;Architects Daughter&quot;&gt;Leader is elected&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=20;fontFamily=Architects Daughter;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DArchitects%2BDaughter;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="3828" y="3569" width="638" height="269" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="fM6e5OibFkX16gMwJjKR-5" value="&lt;font face=&quot;Comic Sans MS&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;Point-of-sale&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Comic Sans MS&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;(Web-site Checkout page)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;aspect=fixed;rounded=1;sketch=1;curveFitting=1;jiggle=2;fontFamily=Architects Daughter;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DArchitects%2BDaughter;fillColor=default;" parent="1" vertex="1">
